# Force LF line endings for files that are executed inside Docker / Linux containers.
#
# On Windows, a global `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites these to CRLF on checkout.
# A CRLF'd shebang line (`#!/bin/sh\r`) makes the Linux kernel fail with
# "exec .../script.sh: no such file or directory", which crashes the
# rails/vite containers on `docker compose up`.
#
# Keep these files LF regardless of the host OS.
*.sh              text eol=lf
*.rb              text eol=lf
Dockerfile        text eol=lf
*Dockerfile*      text eol=lf
docker/Dockerfile text eol=lf
bin/*             text eol=lf
